      <CHAR>결함 및 파손 정도가 심각하거나 덮개 등이 탈락된 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW>
      <ROW>
        <CELL BorderFill="114" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="6118">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="58" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="13">
        <CHAR>평가 등급</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL>
        <CELL BorderFill="25" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3636" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="40952">
          <CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/>
          <PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center">
            <P ParaShape="55" Style="0">
              <TEXT CharShape="3">
        <CHAR>{{if other16.Grade != ""}}금회 조사 결과 현재 상태를 “{{other16.Grade}}등급”으로 판정함.{{else}} {{end}}</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW>
    </TABLE>
    <CHAR/>
  </TEXT>
</P>

<P ParaShape="103" Style="2">
  <TEXT CharShape="16"/>
</P>
{{if attachimageCount == 0}}
